```json
{
  "disclosure": {
    "hidden": [3, 9],
    "reveal_condition": "医生反复追问或表示保密才说",
    "instruction": "..."
  },
  "cognition": {"instruction": "..."},
  "logic": {"instruction": "..."},
  "attitude": {"instruction": "..."},
  "purpose": {"instruction": "..."},
  "expression": {"instruction": "..."}
}
```

其中 `hidden` 是被隐瞒的关键信息编号列表（对应上方患者关键信息的编号），`reveal_condition` 是透露这些信息的条件。

